<title>CHINA: Luks, Tomei, Semi-Tech shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Luks, Tomei, Semi-Tech shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Luks Industrial Co Ltd, Tomei International (Holdings) Ltd and Semi-Tech (Global) Co Ltd were suspended at the companies' request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Luks shares rose HK$0.11 to end at HK$1.26 on Monday, while Tomei International rose HK$0.02 to HK$0.63 and Semi-Tech ended at HK$11.40 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
